# Reference PDFs

These files are NOT committed (see .gitignore) but MUST live here for
Claude Code sessions:

- Omni-Link_II_Rev_3.0.pdf — the protocol spec we're implementing
- Omni-Link.pdf — serial predecessor, useful cross-reference
- 117R00-1_Rev2.pdf — Translator Reference Manual (obtain when possible)
- 117A00-1_install_manual.pdf — short install guide

Contributors must place these files here manually (they are not redistributable).
